cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the associated paper
  (preferred-citation below) and, optionally, this repository itself.
type: software
title: "SWOT Multi-Product WSE Pipeline — Pantanal Rivers"
abstract: >-
  A Jupyter notebook that downloads and processes all four SWOT Level-2
  hydrology products (PIXC, Raster, Node, Reach) for a set of in-situ
  gauging stations, corrects the Reach product's water surface elevation for
  the reach-to-gauge offset, cross-checks completeness across products, and
  de-duplicates the final tables.
